65 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (She then visited the patient at home and provided attentive, professional care. With patience and precision, she carefully trimmed, shaped and cleaned his fingernails and toenails, taking every precaution to ensure that he experienced no discomfort. But her visit did not end with grooming. She spent time with the patient and his family, listening to their concerns and offering practical advice and guidance. Her willingness to stay, listen and engage with them brought an added sense of reassurance and support to the family.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
66 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (For the patient, it was a small but meaningful restoration of comfort. For his family, it brought relief after months of worry and hesitation. But Padmaja saw the experience as something more than simply providing a grooming service.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
